<title>AUSTRALIA: Rugby league-Australian premiership results.</title>
<headline>Rugby league-Australian premiership results.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Australian rugby league premiership playoff matches at the weekend.</p>
<p>Played Sunday:</p>
<p>St George  36  Sydney City  16</p>
<p>Played Saturday:</p>
<p>    Cronulla   22  Brisbane     16</p>
<p>Semifinal schedule:</p>
<p> Saturday, September 21: North Sydney v St George</p>
<p> Sunday, September 22:   Manly v Cronulla</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
